e": "value converted, but failed to roundtrip! val: 16711422", "fixed_commit": "d7673f9022156bb32bbc02ad474955fbd043a39a", "fixed_tree": "8e82cf2f82d91fe8be7c074b054be938320a9ef9", "fixes": [{"commit": "d7673f9022156bb32bbc02ad474955fbd043a39a", "parent": "5b0c6cfcad2fe39aaab94f301ca9959696e0a1f9"}], "patch": "patches/d7673f9022156bb32bbc02ad474955fbd043a39a-1/20260924T174537Z-2895e6f0.patch", "provenance": "verbatim", "restored_source_matches": true, "runs": {"buggy": {"exit_code": 0, "log": "evidence/d7673f9022156bb32bbc02ad474955fbd043a39a-1/20260924T174537Z-2895e6f0/buggy.log", "named_result": null, "tests_run": 0, "timed_out": false}, "fixed": {"exit_code": 0, "log": "evidence/d7673f9022156bb32bbc02ad474955fbd043a39a-1/20260924T174537Z-2895e6f0/fixed.log", "named_result": null, "tests_run": 0, "timed_out": false}, "restored": {"exit_code": 0, "log": "evidence/d7673f9022156bb32bbc02ad474955fbd043a39a-1/20260924T174537Z-2895e6f0/restored.log", "named_result": null, "tests_run": 0, "timed_out": false}}, "test_sources": [{"commit": "d7673f9022156bb32bbc02ad474955fbd043a39a", "paths": ["compact_str/src/repr/boxed/capacity.rs"]}], "tests": ["repr::boxed::capacity::tests::test_all_valid_32bit_values"]}, "shard": "compact_str", "status": "blocked", "subject": "fix: Test case discovered by AFL (#161)", "summary": "On 32-bit targets, inline capacity 16711422 encodes as [254, 254, 254, 254], colliding with the old heap-capacity marker. Decoding therefore incorrectly treats an inline capacity as heap-stored. The fix uses 255 for the marker's capacity bytes, retaining HEAP_MASK only in the final byte, placing the marker beyond valid inline capacities. The selected test was added by this fix and requires a 32-bit target to detect this regression; it belongs to the compact_str library package, not compact_str-fuzz. No tests were executed.", "updated_at": "2026-09-24T17:48:31.608900+00:00"}
